* I maintain a Lojban-related teaching website: [http://lodockikumazvati.org/|lo do ckiku ma zvati]. {lo do ckiku ma zvati} is the Lojban version of "[http://whereareyourkeys.org/|Where are your Keys?]", a language fluency game.
* I maintain some [Lojban-related packages] for the [http://sharism.cc|本NanoNote].
